WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.530
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.470
A Christmas event sponsored by Kira Kira City?

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:15.660
Indeed.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.040
They've put in a request for the four of you to produce it.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.190
If we're in charge of producing it...

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.420
That means we'll have full creative freedom to do what we want.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.150
That gets me going!

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.670
I wonder why we were singled out.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.050
Come in.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.370
We've been eagerly awaiting you.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.160
The chairman of Kira Kira City's shopping district!

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:44.230
Hello. It's a pleasure to see you ladies again.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:49.570
He is the head planner of this year's event committee.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:54.560
Our visitors had a wonderful time thanks to you all last year.

00:00:54.560 --> 00:01:00.080
This year, we would like to ask you to bring holiday spirit to the entire town, not just the shopping area.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.420
Will you accept?

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.610
Of course!

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.960
Please allow us to take charge.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:12.270
We'll make sure to bring everyone a fun Christmas event!

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.520
The Kira Kira Idol Christmas Night, huh.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.360
I can hardly wait.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:58.780
We have the S4 Christmas Live on the same day, 
so it will be extra tough to balance.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:04.620
Our show is at noon on the 24th and the event starts at night, so we should be fine schedule-wise.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:09.620
Yep! Let's work together to make sure both go smoothly!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.580
Yume, you seem a lot more into this than usual.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:19.840
It's just so great that we get to be on the same stage as last year and show off how much we've grown!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.050
Yeah, you're right about that.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:23.220
I agree.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.220
Oh, right!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:28.270
Let's make the theme of the event "thank you"!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.770
Thank you?

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:36.360
Yeah. The love and support from our fans 
played a huge part in our growth this year.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.030
That's why I want to express my gratitude.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.280
I like it!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.450
I'm in.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.160
Me too. How should we do it?

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.290
I've got an idea.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.040
A Christmas event?

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.420
That does sound intriguing.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.550
Venus Ark is home to idols from around the world.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:02.630
I think it would be enjoyable for visitors to see how Christmas is celebrated in different countries.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:03.930
I agree.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:08.310
We owe a lot to Japanese Aikatsu fans as well.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.350
We'd love to participate.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.180
Then!

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.390
I'll ask Elza about it.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:22.950
The dress of miracles, ruler of the stars, 
able to illuminate even the darkest abyss!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:28.200
I hold in my hands the Sun Dress I could once only dream of.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.450
Come in.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.080
Elza, do you have a minute?

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.370
Rei?

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:38.750
I'm happy your dream has finally come true.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.880
Congratulations again.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.090
So, did you need something?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:46.590
Yume invited us to their Christmas event.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.310
Splendid, I'm sure. Do as you like.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.890
Won't you participate?

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.310
Leave if your business is through.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.440
I'm only interested in the Final Tournament.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.320
There, I'll take first place and become the true perfect idol.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.450
I'm unstoppable with my Sun Dress!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:16.460
Now then, I'd like to begin the planning meeting for the Kira Kira Idol Christmas Night!

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.710
The main venue will be the plaza by the train station.{we don't really identify places by ekimae in English, so this? I prefer it over stationfront plaza}

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:29.720
I'm thinking of setting up a variety of original booths so that every visitor will be able to find something they enjoy.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:33.220
Here, here! There's something Kirara really wants to do!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.810
What's that?

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.310
In a word, surfing!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:42.650
Christmas comes during summer in New Zealand! Santa rides the waves to visit us.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:46.240
But Christmas is the dead of winter in Japan. He'd catch a cold here.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.070
Aww!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:53.330
Um, in Finland, we spend Christmas with family.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:57.460
Relatives you don't often get to see all come together.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:01.460
We also exchange presents with everyone.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.800
It's cozy... it's very cozy!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.800
Nice, I like the sound of that.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:13.350
Back in New York, a huge Christmas tree with decorations is set up in the middle of the city.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.480
It's bright and beautiful from all angles,

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.940
and just looking at it fills you with happiness.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:27.610
I'd like to decorate a tree so grandly it is as radiant as Christmas itself.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.530
Yes, that would be good.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.950
We've got a lot of wonderful ideas.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:35.870
Then let's split into teams and start preparing right away.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.750
Ako-chan and Rei-san will scout the venue.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:39.620
Yes.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:39.620
Sure.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.590
Rola and Aria-chan will make the presents.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:43.630
Okay!

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:43.630
Yes.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:46.880
Mahiru-chan and Kirara-chan will promote it.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.050
Got it.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.050
Okay!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:52.010
And that leaves Yume as the chief producer who oversees each part.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:52.890
Yep!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.810
Will you be fine by yourself?

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.270
I won't be alone.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.640
Come in!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.270
Koharu.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.440
Sorry I'm running late.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.440
No, you got here just in time.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.690
That's good.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:12.320
Now then, I've got a favor I'd like to ask you.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:18.410
Will you help me produce this event?

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.960
Me?

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.790
Sure, I'll do it.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:26.550
If that's what you want, I'll support you to the best of my ability.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:29.470
Thank you! That'll be a huge help.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:34.220
All right! Everyone, I'll be counting on you!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.220
Okay!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.280
Ready?

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.070
Osu!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.580
Aikatsu!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.880
Thank you very much.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.430
Okay!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.220
Girls, you ready?

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.550
Yeah!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.310
Let's do this!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.310
All together!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.680
Aikatsu!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.990
It really is heavy...

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.610
Hey, boiled octo.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.870
That looks like fun. Mind if we join?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.120
S-Subaru-kyun?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.210
You did well.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:29.080
I can't let a lady do all the heavy lifting.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.710
Leave it to me.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:34.130
I'll make you proud to have a brother like me.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:35.550
Guys...

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:38.890
All right, let's get it up in one fell swoop!

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.470
Here we go!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.780
Lovely... it's very lovely!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.950
How very intriguing.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.280
Yume-chan, we did it!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:04.790
Yeah! Now we're all set!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.460
It's finally tonight.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.630
I'm looking forward to it so much I can't contain my excitement!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.590
Me too.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.100
Yume-chan.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:28.100
You know, I couldn't be happier to be able to spend Christmas with you all.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.610
Remember how I was in Italy during the holiday last year?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:36.110
While I liked being able to spend Christmas with my family,

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.740
in truth, I would've preferred to be with my friends.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.410
Koharu-chan...

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:47.000
Hey, Yume-chan! It's time to get going!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.250
Coming!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.290
All right, Koharu-chan. I'll leave this in your hands.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.460
Got it. Good luck with your S4 concert.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.750
Thanks!

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:24.030
Everyone! We've got an important announcement to make today.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.990
Listen and try not to freak out.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.300
Merry Christmas.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.810
Welcome, and please enjoy.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.060
Christmas! It's very Christmas!

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.190
Merry Christmas!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.610
Sakuraba Rola. {doesn't it sound like he's saying Sakura wa Rola or something?}{in spain, to drink is to live}

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.950
Who are you?

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.030
I've finally found you.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.420
There are so many visitors!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.210
They all look like they're having fun.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.170
Yes!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.710
I'm so glad.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:19.630
Let's go!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.300
Thank you for the ride.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.590
There's still time, right?

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:25.680
I think so.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:26.680
Well then...

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:30.180
S-Subaru-kyun!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.190
Today's show was a real blast.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.280
<i>Subaru-kyun's drinking cocoa! {hot if you want}{if you want}</i>

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:43.360
<i>I want to become the cocoa! {one of us}</i>

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:47.700
But man, it's another Christmas with just the guys.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.700
Oh? Was there a girl you'd rather be on a date with?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.250
Th-There isn't!

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.170
Look at him all flustered! Subaru-kun's so honest.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.540
Shut up!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:01.340
In any case, we should enjoy this one with just us.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.510
After all, it'll be the last Christmas we can be together.

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:10.600
Yeah, we'll be scattered all around next year. How to put it...

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.220
It'll feel lonely?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.770
Guess so.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.340
I'm glad it worked out in the end.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.090
Honestly, it surprised me too.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.010
Right?

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.180
You think?

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.300
<i>M4 is breaking up...</i>

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:53.680
<i>I simply can't believe it...</i>

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.140
<i>What'll happen to Subaru-kyun?</i>

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.940
<i>And... what about him?</i>

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.900
What was that feeling just now?

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:11.370
I only have eyes for Subaru-kyun... so why would I think of him?

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.700
What're you muttering about?

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:18.000
I saw you eavesdropping on us, you bad girl.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:22.250
Wh-What about you?! It's awful of you to break up like this!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.550
Why didn't you say anything to me?!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:28.880
If you break up, then...

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:33.060
I... won't be able to see you anymore.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.020
Sorry.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.650
M4 isn't breaking up.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.780
But you said you'd be scattered...

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.280
Because we're making our solo debuts.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.120
Subaru and Nozomu are expanding into Asia.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.490
Asahi will be focusing on his acting.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.580
And I'll be trying my hand at newscasting.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.540
Solo debuts? Then that means...

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:04.210
You can come see me whenever you want.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:10.680
How dare you deceive me like that!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:13.850
I don't recall saying a single lie to you.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.640
In any case, I take it all back, Kira Kanata!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.520
Never show your face before me again!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.770
Goodbye!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.900
Merry Christmas, Saotome Ako!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.530
Merry Christmas...

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.870
An international debut... for me?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:42.170
You were brilliant at your last performance.{yeah I know technically but}

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:45.210
But I ended up losing to Elza-san...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.920
Non, non, non!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.590
It's not about winning or losing.

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:53.760
You are <i>mon épice</i>. The spice of life.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.810
Your singing brings peace to your listeners' hearts.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:01.310
Won't you join me and take on the world?

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.690
Me, take on the world?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.520
Yes.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.900
Someone really is always watching.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:14.450
As long as you work hard, someone will see you!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:20.200
It is time for tonight's main event at last, the Christmas song!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.870
Visitors, please assemble in front of the stage.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.210
Excuse me, I need to get running!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:30.300
You don't need to rush your answer. Think it through carefully.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.420
I will.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.810
Okay!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.520
We're all here now.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.850
Let's get pumped and do this!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.190
Yeah!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.940
Good luck, everyone. I'll be cheering for you.

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:51.440
You're singing with us too, Koharu-chan.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.360
What?

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:57.990
B-But the offer was only for the four of you who did last year's Christmas show.

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:02.620
If you had been in Japan, it would've been all five of us.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:03.580
She's right.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:04.370
Yeah.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.040
It's only natural.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.250
Girls...

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.840
Let's go on together, Koharu-chan!

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.010
Okay!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:17.720
Are we ready?

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.220
Into the Holy Night!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.480
May our song resound!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.450
Everyone!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:32.580
Thank you so much!

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.420
Isn't it mysterious?{#fakekeyframes}{sugoi, you fixed it before I did}

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:40.090
We held this event to show our gratitude,

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.010
but now we're the ones being thanked.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.510
Perhaps the feeling is infectious.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:47.600
That must be it.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.890
Oh yeah! I almost forgot something important.

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:57.610
Girls, thank you for always being by my side.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:01.280
I can keep moving forward and shining bright because you're here.

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.070
Thanks so much!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:05.990
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:10.830
I had a wonderful Christmas because of you all. Thank you!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:16.460
It's kind of embarrassing putting it into words, but I'm so grateful for you all as well.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:21.710
Thank you for everything. I treasure each and every one of you.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:25.470
I was... thinking the same thing too.

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.470
So, um...

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:29.640
Thank you...

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:32.270
I said thank you!

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.600
It's snowing!

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:55.120
Encore! Encore!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:22:01.630
Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.880
Everyone, thank you for the encore!

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.010
We'll make tonight the best Christmas ever!

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:13.930
We want to share these feelings with everyone here.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.890
So we'll sing with all our hearts!

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:18.900
To all of you out there!

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:21.820
Happy Merry Christmas!

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:23.980
Merry Christmas!

00:23:55.910 --> 00:24:00.120
I'm so happy we were able to hold our Christmas show this year with you, Koharu-chan!

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:02.920
I hope our song was a wonderful present for them.

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:05.920
May everyone have a day full of cheer.

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:07.250
Ready, and...

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:09.300
Happy Merry Christmas!

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:13.430
First thing after the New Year, 
it's our first try at a skit?

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:14.800
Isn't the bar set too high?

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:17.720
I'm so excited I'm gonna explode!

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:19.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:22.100
It's New Year's! Everyone Gather Round!

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:24.350
Become the first-star idol!
